760 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 562 0 R
/E (Kazan Federal University \(KFU\) is one of the oldest and most prestigious institutions of higher education in Russia, renowned for its rich academic heritage, scientific achievements, and global outlook. Established in 1804, the university has played a central role in the development of education, research, and intellectual thought in the Russian Federation and beyond. Located in the historic city of Kazan, KFU serves as a major educational and cultural hub, attracting students and scholars from across the world.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
761 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 562 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
762 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 562 0 R
/E (KFU offers a wide range of undergraduate, graduate, and doctoral programs across diverse disciplines, including natural sciences, engineering, medicine, social sciences, humanities, and information technology. The university comprises numerous institutes and faculties, each equipped with modern facilities, research centers, and laboratories that support cutting-edge research and innovation. Its academic structure is designed to foster interdisciplinary learning and equip students with the skills required to address contemporary global challenges.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
