765 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 562 0 R
/E (Beyond academics, KFU provides a vibrant campus life that encourages cultural exchange, personal development, and community engagement. Students benefit from a diverse and inclusive environment, enriched by the presence of international students from various countries. The university also promotes extracurricular activities, including sports, arts, and student organizations, which contribute to the holistic development of its students.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
766 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 562 0 R
/E (In conclusion, Kazan Federal University stands as a symbol of academic tradition blended with modern innovation. With its strong emphasis on research, internationalization, and quality education, KFU continues to play a vital role in shaping the future of higher education in Russia and contributing to the global academic community.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
