/E (Kazan Federal University, with its unique 222-year-old school of Oriental Studies, serves as a platform uniting these areas. We are confident that the research presented in this volume will provide a solid theoretical basis for the plenary discussions and working sessions of the conference. I express my deep gratitude to the authors for their thorough elaboration of the topics, to the reviewers for their high professionalism in selecting the materials, and to the Organizing Committee for preparing the publication for print.)
