<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 566 0 R
/E (In an era marked by profound geopolitical transformation and the emergence of new regional and global realities, academic dialogue and intellectual cooperation have become increasingly important for fostering mutual understanding and sustainable partnerships among nations. The growing relationship between Pakistan and the Russian Federation reflects not only evolving strategic interests but also a shared commitment to regional peace, connectivity, education, and cultural engagement.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
810 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 566 0 R
/E (This conference represents an important academic platform that brings together scholars and experts from diverse backgrounds to exchange ideas, share research, and explore new avenues of cooperation between Pakistan and Russia. Such initiatives play a vital role in strengthening people-to-people connections and promoting constructive engagement through knowledge, research, and diplomacy.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
