/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 569 0 R
/E (In the contemporary international environment, academic diplomacy has become an essential pillar for strengthening bilateral and regional cooperation. Universities, scholars, and research institutions now play a crucial role in fostering informed dialogue and generating new ideas for peace, stability, and sustainable development. This conference aims to provide an intellectual platform where scholars and practitioners from Pakistan, Russia, and other countries can engage in meaningful discussions on geopolitics, Eurasian connectivity, economic cooperation, regional security, education, culture, and the emerging multipolar world order.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
