/E (Komal Khan is serving as a Research Officer at the Strategic Vision Institute \(SVI\), Islamabad. She was an InteRussia Fellow in International Relations \(Spring 2025 cohort\), reflecting her engagement with international academic and policy networks. Her research focuses on nuclear strategy, arms control, great power politics, and military modernization in the Indian Ocean region. She has contributed to scholarly and policy discussions on strategic stability and evolving security dynamics. Previously, she has served as a Visiting Faculty member at Bahria University, Islamabad, and the University of Peshawar, and has also worked as a researcher at the Institute of Strategic Studies Islamabad \(ISSI\). Her combined academic and policy experience positions her at the intersection of research, teaching, and strategic analysis, with a strong focus on contemporary global security challenges.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [1]
>>
