/E (Nazir Zaman Magsi is a Lecturer in the Department of Management at Moscow Polytechnic University. His professional and research interests focus on strategic management, the development and application of information technologies, and process automation in educational and organizational systems. His academic work also explores the transformation of vocational education and training models, with an emphasis on adapting to technological and economic changes. In addition, he conducts research on regional economic processes and Eurasian economic integration, particularly in the context of foreign economic activity. An interdisciplinary scholar, he has also engaged with emerging directions in seismological research, reflecting a broad and diverse research profile. Through his work, he aims to contribute to the advancement of management practices, technological integration, and regional economic development in a rapidly evolving global environment.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [1]
>>
