/E (I am an analyst, researcher, writer, host, moderator, communication strategist and event organiser. I have done masters in DSS from QAU Islamabad and masters in Mass Communication from AIOU Islamabad. I am associated with leading think tanks in Pakistan. These include PICS, MSF, PAYF and IRS where I am appointed as Communication Strategist. I have contributed more than 400 articles in English in international and domestic print media focusing on various aspects of security, geo-politics, international affairs, maritime affairs, regional connectivity and public diplomacy. I have hosted TV shows from the digital platform with renowned scholars, analysts and Subject Matter Experts. I am an alumnus of MARSEW from Pakistan Navy War College, Lahore, NSW from NDU Islamabad, NMW from NDU and NWB organised by Govt of Baluchistan, Pakistan. I have also attended Fellowships with different organisations/ institutes notably IPDS Bangkok, AIR Center Baku, Azerbaijan, FES, RCSS Colombo, Sri Lanka.)
