/E (Dr. Omme Asma is a dedicated faculty member in the Department of Political Science at Government College University, Lahore. With a strong academic background and a commitment to excellence in teaching and research, her areas of interest include international relations, political theory, and contemporary global politics. She has contributed to academic scholarship through research publications and active participation in conferences and seminars. The second author, Prof. Dr. Fauzia Ghani, serves as the Chairperson of the Department of Political Science at the same institution. She is a distinguished academic with extensive experience in research, teaching, and academic leadership. Her work focuses on governance, public policy, and international relations, and she has played a significant role in promoting research culture and academic development within the department.)
