/E (Prof. Dr. Salma Naz is a distinguished scholar in Political Science and International Relations, currently serving as professor of Political Science at Minhaj University, Lahore. She holds a Ph.D. from the University of the Punjab and has over two decades of experience in teaching and research. Her expertise spans research methodology, political theory, international relations, crisis management, globalization, governance, and social responsibility. She has published extensively in international journals and presented her research at global conferences. She has also supervised numerous MPhil students across Political Science, Pakistan Studies, History, and International Relations. Known for her analytical skills and ability to communicate complex ideas, she is dedicated to mentoring students and fostering critical thinking. As a leader, she promotes interdisciplinary research, industry collaboration, and community engagement.)
