/E (My name is Noor Jehan. I am Assistant Professor at Iqra National University, Peshawar. I live at Hayatabad Peshawar with my 3 children and husband. I am hardworking and competent person. I love taking initiatives and facing challenges. I am honest individual with good work ethics having ability to work as part of a team or through my own initiatives. I have Served as the Head of the MPhil English Program, was responsible for academic planning, program administration, coordination of faculty and research activities, and ensuring compliance with university and HEC regulations. I love research work. I have 8 publications in different journals on language, literature and linguistics. I love visiting and exploring the world specially Russia. I did my PhD thesis on Russian language and its role in the economic development of Central Asia. I would appreciate if I got such opportunity to visit Russia.)
/Pg 103 0 R
