/E (Research paper impact of financial sanctions on Russia on Russia -Pakistan Trade relation and the findable alternative mechanism barter trade local currency settlement the Russia SPFS and Mir system digital currency cryptocurrency-based solutions and commodity swap schemes based on mixed methods approaches which includes both qualitative interviews documents analysis and secondary trade data \(UN COMTRADE ,PBS ,OEC\) the research considers the viability ,risk and scalability of these alternative the result also show that despite the enormous impediments posed by sanction the two state have began to devise some adaptive measure e.g. new barter agreement discounted energy deals and exploration settlement in non USD currencies .The paper suggests serval policy regulatory and institutional interventions to promote safe open and sanction based bilateral trade.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [3]
>>
