/E (A.N. Obukhova graduated from the Moscow State Institute of International Relations \(MGIMO\) with a Master's degree in Economics and a concentration in Persian, English, and Spanish. She completed a full-time postgraduate program in Global Economy at the Institute of Oriental Studies of the Russian Academy of Sciences. She was an affiliate member of UK ACCA. She has over 16 years of experience in investment banking \(Renaissance Capital, VTB Capital, Sinara Investment Bank\). She was ranked among the top investment analysts in Russia and the EMEA \(Europe, Middle East, and Africa\) region by professional ratings such as Extel and Institutional Investors. She has authored over 400 analytical reviews in English on ICT companies and markets in Russia, Eastern Europe, and Asia.)
/Pg 108 0 R
