/P 658 0 R
/E (In the modern economy, the global landscape of cooperation between Russia and Pakistan continues to evolve and serves as a valuable resource for shaping the economic policies of both countries. To deepen the collective understanding that trade relations are far from the only point of contact between Moscow and Islamabad, an impetus for investment in trade and energy ties with Russia is needed. This could contribute to the successful development of the entrepreneurial environment and more effective national economic policies.)
/Pg 109 0 R
/K [3]
>>
