/E (Dr. Waqas Ahmed is a Assistant Professor at Department of Marketing & Entrepreneurship, HSE University Nizhny Novgorod Russia since 2023. He did his PhD in Management Science & Engineering from Nanjing University of Aeronautics & Astronautics, China in 2021, MBA from Quaid-e-Azam University Pakistan in 2004 and MA Management from UK in 2012. He got prestigious Chinese Government Scholarship \(2015-2019\) and was awarded for Best Researcher and Service Oriened Employee for 2021 and Program designer in 2025. He has published over 20 SCI/Scopus publications.  His areas of interest include innovation management, regional economics, decision sciences, conflict management, public policy, environmental issues and entrepreneurship. Mr. Imran Ali is a PhD student at HSE Moscow. )
