/E (This article analyzes the role of education as a key tool for intercultural dialogue and the development of cooperation between Russia and Pakistan. It highlights the main areas of student and faculty exchange programs, as well as joint research projects in fields such as medicine, information technology, energy, and industry. Particular attention is given to the mechanisms for implementing educational initiatives, their impact on bilateral relations, and prospects for further development, including the creation of joint programs and digital platforms. The article emphasizes the importance of strengthening academic exchange for building trust, developing an innovative economy, and promoting peace and stability in the region. It concludes with key challenges and proposals for overcoming them, as well as prospects for expanding cooperation.)
/Pg 116 0 R
/K [3]
>>
