/P 683 0 R
/E (This presentation examines the systematic integration of the Arabic language into the Russian secondary education system, particularly within the Republic of Tatarstan, as a pedagogical blueprint for Pakistan. It explores the development of standardized textbooks and modern communicative methodologies that balance linguistic proficiency with cultural and religious literacy. By highlighting the Russian model's success in secular and religious educational contexts, the study proposes a framework for Pakistan to enhance its own Arabic curricula through international academic cooperation and shared best practices)
/Pg 134 0 R
/K [3]
>>
