/P 684 0 R
/E (This research presents a comparative analysis of the pedagogical approaches to teaching Hindi and Urdu within the Russian higher education system. It examines the shared linguistic foundation of these languages while highlighting the distinct methodological challenges posed by their different scripts, specialized vocabularies, and cultural contexts. By evaluating current curricula and instructional materials, the study proposes optimized strategies for training philologists and regional specialists in the unique socio-linguistic landscape of South Asia.)
/Pg 135 0 R
/K [3]
>>
