/E (Dr. Tatheer Zahra Sherazi is an Assistant Professor in the Department of International Relations at the National University of Modern Languages \(NUML\) in Islamabad. She is a specialized academic focused on global politics, particularly the rise of China and contemporary security issues.)
/Pg 136 0 R
/K [0 2808 0 R 2]
